# comments
# comment 00193ec0 kwlnTaskUpdate: skip (return 1) by kwlnFlags bits 30/31 + prio 0x816..0x1CE5, pause word A + 0x833..0x103D, word B + 0x1064..0x1CD9, or state flag 0x20; else gPads = neutral (flag 0x10) or gWorkPads, then update(task) with $v0 = -1 preset: nonzero result replaces the callback; -1 on a running task = Destroy + DestroyHierarchy(child), return 0; whole state word 3 = return 0; else timer++
# comment 00195690 kwlnTaskDetachAllChildren: a child whose parent field is not the task clears the PREVIOUS matching child again, and $a1 on entry when there is none (callers leave kwlnTaskDetachParent's / kwlnTaskRemoveFromList's $a1 there)
